            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## SPC and model monitoring\n\nAttainX \u00b7 Fictional data \u00b7 Recorded replay. The forecast is frozen; actual counts arrive afterward. Use the queue filter to focus on one process. No live monitoring is connected."
