            "name": "workflow",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### Counts \u2192 historical features \u2192 rules and forecasts \u2192 review\n\nSPC asks whether the process changed. Input monitoring asks whether model inputs differ from training. Performance monitoring asks whether saved predictions became less accurate after actuals arrived."
